Package: iranhealthatlas
Type: Package
Title: Iran Health Accessibility Atlas
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Alireza", "Chamanzar", , "alirezach70@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A reproducible pipeline that estimates car travel time from
    every populated 1 km grid cell in Iran to the nearest hospital, using
    OpenStreetMap roads and hospitals, WorldPop population estimates and
    geoBoundaries administrative units. Results are summarised by province,
    county and nationally, validated automatically and published as a Quarto
    website.
